stem:
You need to complete the network settings of the workspace in the infra/main.bicep file to meet the security requirements.

How should you complete the Bicep code? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.

```bicep
resource mlw 'Microsoft.MachineLearningServices/workspaces@2024-04-01' = {
  name: 'mlw-noshow-prod'
  location: location
  identity: {
    type: 'SystemAssigned'
  }
  properties: {
    storageAccount: storage.id
    keyVault: vault.id
    applicationInsights: appInsights.id
    containerRegistry: registry.id
    publicNetworkAccess: '[[1]]'
    managedNetwork: {
      isolationMode: '[[2]]'
      outboundRules: {
        pypi: {
          type: '[[3]]'
          destination: 'pypi.org'
        }
        claims: {
          type: '[[4]]'
          destination: {
            serviceResourceId: claimsStorage.id
            subresourceTarget: 'blob'
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```
